rmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/south-dakota/brookings-county"],["ARC or PLC in Brookings County","/arc-plc/south-dakota/brookings-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2026 so far on the middle of the grids, January to February came in at 31% of normal and February to March at 49%. Every grid in the county had its driest year in 1976, with grid 28935 down to 45% of normal.</p>"}
